            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Less nagging about questions you've moved past

- A question you've seen stops waiting on you once you move on to another session
- Opening Perch leads with what just changed, not a question you already saw
- A new session's long title shimmers as one line while it starts
]]></description>
